# Security Policy
## Supported Versions
This project is continuously maintained and updated. We always fix potential security vulnerabilities in the latest version.

## Vulnerability Reporting
If you find any security risks or vulnerabilities, please do not disclose them publicly.
Please contact the maintainer through GitHub private message with detailed vulnerability information.

## Repair Mechanism
We will respond within 48 hours, verify the problem, fix vulnerabilities and release updated versions to ensure project security.
